==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/EP5|Episode 5]]===
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone37.mp3}} "[[Brimstone]], it's Harbor. That was some 'New Hire' orientation, huh. Is it always that dangerous to join your crew or did I get special treatment, haha... Jokes aside, I owe you my thanks. You put your whole team on the line to save me. That's... not something I'll forget. It's hard to trust anyone after being on the run. But seeing the stunts you pull for a rescue, well... that's a start. But as for the immediate future, I'll keep watching my own back. Just until the nerves settle."
*{{AC|Research Wing Recording Complete.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription between Astra and [[Harbor]], see [[Range/Lore/EP5#Cypher's_Office_2|Range/Lore/EP5 → v5.08 → Cypher's Office]].)''
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone38.mp3}} "Brimstone. [[Astra]], [[Killjoy]], and I finished our analysis. We looked at it a dozen different ways, and it always comes back the same. The [[City of Flowers]] on [[Omega]] is a multiverse nexus. If [[Legion]] powers up that nexus with Alpha's version of the city ruined... there's nothing left to absorb the shock... the result... The result would be catastrophic, millions of lives in my home country, lost, that's not a scenario I'm willing to entertain. No one else can stop Legion from pulling the trigger, this is on us! So get a team ready, and make sure I'm at the top of the list!"
*{{AC|Skye Audio Log Omega Mission Complete.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription between [[Astra]], Harbor, [[Skye]] and Atlas troops, see [[Range/Lore/EP5#Cypher's_Office_4|Range/Lore/EP5 → v5.12 → Cypher's Office]].)''

===[[Range/Lore/EP8|Episode 8]]===
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone82.mp3}} ''(This voicemail was left by both Harbor and Astra at the same time.)''
**[[File:Harbor icon.png|25px|link=Harbor]]: "Brimstone, Astra and I are over at the α-[[Lotus]] site, or should I say what's left of it. We wanted to come back and see if there was any pertinent information here now that we know a little about this [[Scions of Hourglass]] group. Suffice to say, while the [[Omega]] site is still bristling with [[radianite]] signatures, this place has been scrubbed clean. We've also been- oh-... yeah yeah yeah... one moment..."
**[[File:Astra icon.png|25px|link=Astra]]: "Hey, Water Boy! Hand me the phone! Brim, Harbor gave you the deets, hm? Look, Hourglass kills scientists instead of kidnapping them and they tried to leave no witnesses to that journal, huh? And now this with the Nexus?! This is about erasing information, keeping it from the public! That place the journal describes? It will show us how deep this goes! Of this I am certain!"

===[[Range/Lore/V25|Season 2025]]===
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone118.mp3}} "Hi, Brimstone. Just so you know, my artifact's been acting strange lately. Nothing dangerous, just a bit... restless. I can't always interpret these temperamental episodes but it's best not to ignore them. Like wildlife before a storm. We might not know why they're uneasy, but they do. Anyway, [[Astra]] and I will look into it and keep you informed. Wish us luck."

===[[Range/Lore/V26|Season 2026]]===
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone130.mp3}} "Brimstone, I've been thinking about what [[Sage]] mentioned earlier. Huh, I think it's a great idea, especially if she brings a few other healers along, they might learn a thing or two with her up in the mountains. Plus, it could be a nice recentering of sorts. Prioritizing their well-being is prioritizing ours, after all. Just let me talk to [[Waylay]], hm? See if the two of us can cover training here while Sage is away. Shouldn't be a problem."

